VALUES('99b502df-b929-4734-8a6b-0784d29c9554', 'Currently are you employed full-time?<BR><BR>*"Full-time" means working at least 35 hours per week at one or more jobs.*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:19.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E37_current_full_time_employment', '37');
VALUES('1ccf6fa2-81c8-4063-9f82-421986578565', 'Currently are you employed part-time?<BR><BR>*"Part-time" means working at least 1–34 hours per week at one or more jobs.*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:20.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E38_current_part_time_employment', '38');
VALUES('5946e5bc-9da9-4376-a7ba-bff30af0ca50', 'In the past year, did you complete and apprenticeship, internship, or other on-the-job training, either paid or unpaid?<BR><BR>*This means internships, or any work experience, either paid or unpaid, that helped you acquire employment-related skills (which can include specific trade skills such as carpentry or auto mechanics, or office skills such as word processing or use of office equipment).*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:20.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E39_employment_related_skills', '39');
VALUES('51fcda88-08aa-4ed9-bc1a-9dd761a1cbbe', 'Currently are you receiving social security payments (Supplemental Security Income[SSI, Social Security Disability Insurance (SSDI)], or dependents’ payments)?', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6431', '2010-06-23 18:10:20.000', '2012-09-19 19:02:59.000', 0, 'E40_social_security', '40');
VALUES('da6c5485-d4b3-4d1b-8729-33ec49717c04', 'Currently are you using a scholarship, grant, stipend, student loan, voucher, or other type of educational financial aid to cover any educational expenses?<BR><BR>*Any type of college funding. "Student loan" means a government-guaranteed, low-interest loan for students in college or trade-school.*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:20.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E41_educ_aid', '41');

VALUES('f56e72e1-a346-4bc8-8c50-f56b108fc45f', 'Currently are you receiving ongoing welfare (TANF) payments from the government to support your basic needs?<BR><BR>*Do not consider payments or subsidies for specific purposes, such as unemployment insurance, child care subsidies, education assistance, food stamps or housing assistance in this category.', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:20.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E42_public_financial_assist', '42');

VALUES('37282e19-fbc1-4be3-9085-ff55e211d7db', 'Currently are you receiving public food assistance?<BR><BR>*Public food assistance includes food stamps and assistance from the Women, Infants and Children (WIC) program.*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:20.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E43_public_food_assist', '43');

VALUES('ff3fa818-f36a-4c48-b242-c91b9c867a92', 'Currently are you receiving any sort of housing assistance from the government, such as living in public housing or receiving a housing voucher?<BR>*This does not include payments from the child welfare agency for room and board payments.*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:20.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E44_public_housing_assist', '44');

VALUES('c33aad3b-f23b-4ad8-8d7e-7ed53b2b44ef', 'Currently are you receiving any periodic and/or significant financial resources or support from another source not previously indicated and excluding paid employment?<BR>*This does not include occasional gifts, such as birthday or graduation checks or small donations of food or personal incidentals, child care subsidies, child support for your children or other financial help that does not benefit you directly in supporting yourself.*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:21.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E45_other_financial_support', '45');

VALUES('09be060a-3644-489f-ad48-ea7058e37a04', 'What is the highest educational degree or certification that you have received?', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:21.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E46_highest_educ_certification', '46');

VALUES('6d6b03d0-5475-451b-ad01-e92d5924e73c', 'Currently are you enrolled in and attending high school, GED classes, post-high school vocational training, or college?<BR><BR>*You are still considered enrolled in and attending school if you would otherwise be enrolled in and attending a school that is currently out of session (e.g., Spring break, Summer vacation, etc.).*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:21.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E47_current_enrollment_attendance', '47');

VALUES('78ac5f40-7e98-4630-a677-95df73b0e2e8', 'Currently is there at least one adult in your life, other than your caseworker, to whom you can go for advice or emotional support?<BR><BR>*The definition excludes spouses, partners, boyfriends/girlfriends and current caseworkers. The adult must be easily accessible to you, either by telephone or in person.*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:21.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E48_connection_adult', '48');

VALUES('e871b7b6-ebbd-4d58-ade1-f4a18fd10302', 'In the past two years, were you homeless at any time?<BR><BR>*"Homeless" means that you had no regular or adequate place to live. This includes living in a car, or on the street, or staying in a homeless or other temporary shelter.*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:21.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E49_homelessness', '49');

VALUES('8415ba99-b6cd-4424-b4e2-39748300c2c3', 'In the past two years, did you refer yourself, or have someone else refer you for an alcohol or drug abuse assessment or counseling?', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6439', '2010-06-23 18:10:21.000', '2012-09-19 19:10:47.000', 0, 'E50_substance_abuse_referral', '50');
VALUES('dcce0b8c-f9ed-4f69-a6a4-ddccbe48dac9', 'In the past two years, were you confined in a jail, prison, correctional facility, or juvenile or community detention facility, in connection with allegedly committing a crime?<BR><BR>* This means that you were confined in a jail, prison, correctional facility, or juvenile or community detention facility in connection with a crime (misdemeanor or felony) that you allegedly committed.*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:21.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E51_incarceration', '51');

VALUES('8814af70-6d11-440b-8d93-f7f51826f851', 'In the past two years, did you give birth to or father any children that were born?<BR><BR>*Answer "No" if you are male and do not know.*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:21.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E52_children', '52');

VALUES('789788a1-37b0-406d-9111-7184dc1fb5b7', 'If you responded "Yes" to the previous question, were you married to the child''s other parent at the time each child was born?', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6422', '2010-06-23 18:10:22.000', '2012-09-19 19:02:59.000', 0, 'E53_marriage_at_childs_birth', '53');
VALUES('23a978be-2bd8-446c-b341-68433c98e3f3', 'Currently are you on Medicaid?<BR><BR>*This includes Medical Assistance (MA)*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:22.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E54_medicaid', '54');
VALUES('ae42ff9d-a3a1-4c97-9923-0b5f8891626d', 'Does your health insurance include coverage for medical services?', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:22.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E55_other_health_insurance', '55');
VALUES('b4c39ac6-ad51-4b8a-98c0-b5168360bfce', 'Does your health insurance include coverage for mental health services?', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:22.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E56_health_insurance_type_medical', '56');
VALUES('76175444-7041-486b-8c29-6716dda2d821', 'Does your health insurance include coverage for prescription drugs?', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:22.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E57_health_insurance_type_mental_health', '57');
VALUES('0a346ae9-cadc-4924-8f00-eb60be5a3b2d', 'Currently do you have health insurance, other than Medicaid?<BR><BR>*"Health insurance" means having a third party pay for all or part of health care. This includes health insurance such as group coverage offered by employers or schools, or individual policies that cover medical and/or mental health care and/or prescription drugs, or coverage provided by your parents’ insurance. This also could include access to free health care through a college, Indian Tribe, or other source.*', '', 'DBCR5470', 'DBCR6387', '2010-06-23 18:10:22.000', '2012-09-19 19:01:15.000', 0, 'E58_health_insurance_type_prescription_drugs', '58');
